{"id":"b0f365ef30b0b52a","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-binary-karp-reduction.md","title":"Karp Reduction","display":"df-karp-reduction — Karp Reduction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-binary-karp-reduction","aliases":["73-df-binary-karp-reduction","73-df-karp-reduction"],"display":"df-karp-reduction — Karp Reduction","depends_on":["[[73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-binary-karp-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-binary-karp-reduction</span><span>73-df-karp-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-karp-reduction — Karp Reduction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"69f4f24da36d1d66\" href=\"?note=69f4f24da36d1d66\" title=\"73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one\">73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_m^p\">\\(\\leq_m^p\\)</span> (polynomial-time many-one reducibility, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"69f4f24da36d1d66\" href=\"?note=69f4f24da36d1d66\" title=\"73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one\">73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}karp\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\n\\leq_K\\;\\coloneqq\\;\\leq_m^p\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}karp\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\n\\leq_K\\;\\coloneqq\\;\\leq_m^p\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完